<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 Petera</book>
  <para style="h">2 Petera</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Petera</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petera</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Petera</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua Krista bawih leh tirhkoh Simon Petera chuan, min chhandamtu Isua Krista zârah leh kan Pathian felna zârah rinna kan neih ang nei vete chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian leh kan Lalpa Isua in hriatnaah khawngaihna leh remna in chungah tihpunin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ropuina leh ṭhatna chang ve tûra min kotu kan hriat tâk avânga Pathian ṭiha kan nun theih nân, Pathian thiltihtheihna chuan kan mamawh engkim min pe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, thilpêk a tiam, ropui tak leh hlu tak chu min pe ta a; chuvâng chuan, khawvêl sual châkna, min tichhe thei lak ata in chhuak a, Pathian zia in ṭâwmpui thei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hei vâng hian theihtâwp chhuahin, in rinnaah chuan ṭhatna telh ula, in ṭhatnaah chuan hriatna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />in hriatnaah chuan mahni inthununna, mahni inthununnaah chuan chhelna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in chhelnaah chuan inserh thianghlimna, inserh thianghlimnaah chuan unaute lainatna, unaute in lainatnaah chuan hmangaihna belh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng chu in neiha, a pun zêl chuan kan Lalpa Isua Krista in hriatnaah taima tak leh ṭangkai takah a siam ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng thil nei lote chu mitdel, khaw hawi tawi, an tûn hma sual sil faisak an ni tih theihnghilh tâte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, a kohna leh a thlanna che u hi tilang tûrin theihtâwp chhuahin nghet takin ding rawh u; chutianga dingte chu eng lai mahin an tluchhe lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, kan Lalpa leh Chhandamtu Isua Krista chatuan ramah lâwm takin an luhtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, thutak in hriatah khân nghet takin awm tawh mah ula, hêng thu hi hriat nawntîr fo che u ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He taksa ka put chhûng hi chuan hriat nawntîr ṭhin che u hi ka tih tûrah ka ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Kristan mi hrilh angin he ka taksa hi ka chhuahsan thuai tawh dâwn tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka chhuahsan hnuah pawh, eng lai pawha hêng hi in hriat reng theihna kawng siamsak tûr che uin theihtâwp ka chhuah dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista chu thiltihtheihna nên a lo kal leh tûr thu kan hrilh lai che u khân, thawnthu phuahchawp mai mai hrilh che u kan ni lo ve, a ropuina chu mit ngeia hmutute kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pa Pathian hnên ata chawimawina leh ropuina a dawn lai khân, Ropuibera hnên aṭangin âw a lo chhuak a, “Hei hi ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka chu a ni, a chungah ka lâwm êm êm a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu âw, vân aṭanga lo chhuak chu, keini pawhin tlâng thianghlima a hnêna kan awm lai khân kan hre ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zâwlneite thu lo puan tawh kha a dik ngei tih keini pawhin kan pawm nghet sauh va, nangni pawhin, Vârparh Arsi a lo lan hma chuan, khawvâr hma, zân thima khâwnvâr êng angin, chu thu chu in thinlungah êntuah hmang ula a ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-a hrilhlâwkna thute hi mahni ngaih dân maia hrilh fiah tûr a ni lo tih hre hmasa phawt ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hrilhlâwkna rêng rêng hi mihring thu-a chhuak a ni si lo va, Thlarau Thianghlim hruaiin Pathian hnên ata an sawi zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan mite zîngah zâwlnei der an awm ṭhîn ang khân nangni zîngah pawh zirtîrtu dik lo an lo awm dâwn; mi tichhe thei zirtîrna dik lo an rawn pu lût ru ang a; an Lalber, anmahni tlantu chu phatsanin mahni chhiatna rang takin an thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An awm dân tenawm tak chu miten an chîng ve ang a, anmahni avâng chuan thutak kawng hi sawichhiat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sum an hmuh theih nân duhâm takin an thu phuah chawp chuan sumdâwnna atân an hmang ang che u; nimahsela, an chunga rorêl tawh sa chu a awm mai mai lo vang, chhiatna chuan muhîl lovin a châng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkohten thil sual an tih lai khân Pathianin a zuah lo, hremhmunah a paih a, Rorêl Ni nghâk tûrin khuarkhurum thimah chuan an awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmânlai khawvêl pawh a zuah lo, khawvêl sual tak chunga tui a lêttîr pawh khân, Nova - felna thupuangtu leh mi dang serh leh sâng nei pasarih chauh a nih kha a chhan chhuah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomora khua pawh vaivutah a chantîr a, serh leh sâng nei lote a hrem dân tûr entîr nân a tichhe vek a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lota, mi sualte awm dân pawiti êm êm ṭhîntu erawh chu a chhan chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />chu mi ṭha tak chu an zînga khawsa ve ṭhîn a ni a, an thil sual tih a hmuh leh a hriatte chuan a thin a tina êm êm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan amah ṭihtute chu tuarna laka chhan chhuah dân leh rorêl Ni a lo thlen hma pawha mi sual hrem dân a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An taksa châkna bawlhhlawh anga awmte leh Pathian thuneihna hmusittute lek phei chu hrem dân a hre lehzual. Hêng zirtîrtu dik lote hi an ât huai a, an chapo va, vân mi ropuite pawh khi sawichhiat an hlau lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni aia chak leh thiltithei zâwk vântirhkohte pawhin, Lalpa hmaa hêng mi ropuite chungchâng hi an sawiin ṭawng chhia an hmang ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, hêngho hi ngaihtuahna nei lo, ramsa, mana tihhlum mai tûra lo piangte ang hi an ni, an hriatthiam loh apiang an sawichhia a, ramsa te anga tihhlum an ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An sual man chu an tuar ang. Nilêng lênga nuamtâwl chîng mi an ni a, mi tenawm leh mi bawlhhlawh, in zînga inzep an ni a, in ruai ṭhehnaa an lo tel hian an bum che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An mitin uire tûr an melh reng a, sual tih an kham thei lo. Mi rilru nghet lote an bum a, duhâm dân an thiam hle, ânchhe dawng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawng dik chu an pênsan a, an bo ta. Bosora fapa Balaama kawng an zawh ta. Ani chuan thil sual tih hlâwk berin a ring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mahse, a bawhchhiatnaah chuan zilhhauvin a awm ta a, sabengtung ṭawng thei lo chu mihring angin a lo ṭawng a, zâwlneipa âtna chu tihtâwpsak a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng mite hi tuikhur hna kang chat leh chhûm, thlipui len vêl mai mai ang chauh hi an ni, thim chhah mup chu an awm nân ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu âtthlâk pâwr tak takin an sawi a, an khawvêl nun dân dik lo bânsan hlimte chu tisa châkna hmangin an bum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zalênna pêk an tiam a; mahse, anmahni pawh chu an thil chîn ṭha lo bawih an ni reng si a; tu pawh mai hi anmahni hnehtu bawih an ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Lalpa leh min chhandamtu Isua Krista hriatna avânga khawvêl sual kalsantute chu suala an inhnamhnawiha an tlûk leh chuan, a tîra an awm dân ai khân an awm dân hnuhnûng chu a chhe zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hnêna thupêk thianghlim hre tawh zeta hawisan leh site chuan felna kawng hi lo hre lo law law se an tân a ṭha zâwk tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An awm dân aṭang hian hêng thufing dikzia hi a lang chiang hle: “Ui chuan a luak a ei leh a,” tih leh “Vawkpui bual fai chu chirhdiakah a inbual leh a,” tihte hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Duh takte u, vawi hnih lehkha ka rawn thawnna che u a ni ta. In hriat tawh sa hriat nawntîr che uin nangmahniah rilru thianghlim chawk harh tûrin vawi hnih ka han thawn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei thianghlimte thu leh Lalpa leh Chhandamtu thupêk, in tirhkohten hmâna an hrilh che u kha, hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngah chuan hmusittute, mahni châkna ang zêla awmte an lo chhuak ang tih hre hmasa rawh u. Hmusit êm êmin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Lo kal leh a tiam kha engtin nge ni ta? Min thlahtute an thi zo ta a, thilsiam ṭan tirh ata engkim a ngai rengin a la awm a ni lâwm ni?” an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmânlaiin Pathian thu-a vânte khi siam a nih te, lei chu tui ata siam chhuah a nih te, tui leh tui inkâra dah a nih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuilêt lai khân khawvêl hlui chu, chu tui chuan a chîma a tihchhiatte kha an haider lui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sakhaw pawisa loho chungchâng rêl hun leh tihboral huna meia kâng ral tûrin tûna lei leh vân pawh hi Pathian thuin a khêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Duh takte u, hei hi theihnghilh suh u, Lalpa tân chuan ni khat hi kum sângkhat ang a ni a, kum sângkhat pawh hi ni khat ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat rin dân angin Lalpa hi a thutiam hlen kawngah a muang lo ve; in tân a dawhthei a nî zâwk; tû ma boral a duh lo va, mi zawng zawngin an sual an sima, a hnêna an kîr a duh vâng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa Nî chu rûkru angin a lo thleng ngei dâwn. Chumi nî-ah chuan thâwm ring tak nên vân khi a boral ang a, vâna arsite khi a kâng ral vek ang; lei pawh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng nên a boral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêngte hi chutianga chhe vek tûr a nih si chuan nangniho kha mi eng ang tûr nge in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ni tiam nghâkhlel taka in thlîr reng lai hian mi thianghlim, Pathian tâna inpe mi in ni tûr a ni. Chumi ni-ah chuan vân khi a kâng ral ang a, arsite pawh an tuiral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian tiam, lei thar leh vân thar, a chhûnga dikna awmna chu kan nghâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, duh takte u, hêng thil in nghah lai hian Pathian hmaa thianghlim leh sawisêlbova awm tûrin theihtâwp chhuah ula, amah nên inrem rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa dawhtheihna hi chhandam in nih theihna hun remchângah ngai ula. Pathianin finna a pêk angin kan unaupa duh tak Paula pawhin hêng thu hi a ziak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thu ziak ṭhenkhat chu hriatthiam a har hle, eng mah zir lo leh mi nghet loten Lehkha Thu dang an ngai kawi ang bawkin an ngai kawi a, mahni chhiatna an thlen ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Duh takte u, nangni zawngin in hre tawh a, fîmkhur rawh u; chuti lo zawng pawisak nei loten an hruai bo vang che u a, in nghet ṭha lai in tlu hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan Lalpa leh chhandamtu Isua Krista hriatnaah te, khawngaihnaah te ṭhang lian zêl rawh u. A hnênah chuan tûn aṭanga chatuan thlengin ropuina awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
